Package: nassie
Version: 0.1.12
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-rich, python3-tk, samba
Recommends: policykit-1, python3-qrcode
Maintainer: Caden Lister <cadenlister@gmail.com>
Description: NASsie - cross-platform SMB share configuration wizard
 A terminal-UI wizard by default ('nassie'), with a graphical desktop UI
 available via 'nassie --gui', for creating and managing SMB (Samba)
 shares. Walks the user through share name, path, and
 user credentials, then applies the configuration on Linux by
 installing Samba if needed, writing the smb.conf share block,
 creating the system user, and restarting the Samba services.
 Requests root privileges via a native polkit (pkexec) prompt when
 not already run as root, falling back to a terminal sudo prompt.
